c2.bezier-curves {"sl":{"alt":"Kubična Bézierjeva krivulja s štirimi kontrolnimi točkami, poligonom, konveksno ovojnico in označeno točko (0, 1).","cap":"Označena točka krivulje (0, 1) pri t = 0,5 leži znotraj konveksne ovojnice štirih kontrolnih točk. Do tega pogleda prideš v koraku izračuna pri t = 1/2."},"en":{"alt":"A cubic Bézier curve with four control points, polygon, convex hull and the marked point (0, 1).","cap":"The marked curve point (0, 1) at t = 0.5 lies inside the convex hull of the four control points. Reach this view in the evaluation step at t = 1/2."},"changed":true,"url":"http://127.0.0.1:4387/bezeg-2.0/learn/bezier-curves"}
c2.splines {"sl":{"alt":"Zlepek iz dveh kvadratnih Bézierjevih odsekov s štirimi prostimi točkami, izpeljano točko in kontrolnim poligonom.","cap":"Izpeljana točka (2, −4) je podaljšek zadnje stranice prvega odseka: stična točka (0, −3) je na sredini med (−2, −2) in njo. Odvoda obeh odsekov v stiku sta enaka, (8, −4). Do tega pogleda prideš z vklopom kontrolnega poligona."},"en":{"alt":"A spline of two quadratic Bézier pieces with four free points, the derived point and the control polygon.","cap":"The derived point (2, −4) extends the last edge of the first piece: the joint (0, −3) is midway between (−2, −2) and it. The derivatives of both pieces at the joint are equal, (8, −4). Reach this view by turning on the control polygon."},"changed":true,"url":"http://127.0.0.1:4387/bezeg-2.0/learn/splines"}
